q-system/output/ holds generated artifacts. A one-off helper, a message
draft or a throwaway reproducer is not one. Working files go here --
outside the repo, so they cannot be committed:
  /Users/assafkipnis/projects/kipi-system/.pr22rev/work3/state/scratch/ask-aaa

If it IS a deliverable it belongs where folder-structure.md puts it:
  a harness -> q-system/.q-system/scripts/
  a test    -> q-system/.q-system/scripts/test/
  an RCA    -> q-system/output/rca/
